/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
46. 688.3899999999999864 Td
(Priority Score P = min\(100, Sum\(Weight_i * Ratio_i\)\), where factors include: Case Age \(30%\), Mandated Fast-Track Category) Tj
