/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.137 0.157 0.188 rg
46. 659.3899999999999864 Td
(Soft Preference Fit S = W_spec * SpecMatch + W_work * \(1 - WorkloadRatio\) + W_util * \(1 - RoomLoadRatio\) + W_early *) Tj
